{"seq":3,"slug":"codec-formats","title":"音频编解码与传输","url":"/l-doc-books/h/music-audio/audio-signal-processing/digital-audio-basics/codec-formats","wordCount":1432,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"音频编解码与传输\">音频编解码与传输</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>音频从一路 PCM 数据到网络流，需要依次经过编码、封装与传输三层解耦，本 hub 围绕这三层展开：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>PCM</strong>：未压缩的原始数字音频，参数三元组为（采样率、位深度、通道数），是所有编码的基准。</li>\n<li><strong>心理声学模型</strong>：频率掩蔽、时间掩蔽与绝对听觉阈值共同决定哪些信息可以&quot;安全地丢弃&quot;。</li>\n<li><strong>有损与无损</strong>：有损编码利用感知局限换取高压缩比，无损编码只做可逆压缩。</li>\n<li><strong>容器与编码</strong>：容器（WAV、MP4、Ogg）负责装，编码（PCM、AAC、Opus）负责压，两者是正交概念。</li>\n<li><strong>传输协议</strong>：HLS/DASH 面向点播，WebRTC 面向实时，AES67 面向专业低延迟网络。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>贯穿全篇的取舍是压缩比、延迟与保真度三者之间的不可能三角——实时通信必须牺牲压缩效率，存档场景则用带宽换取完全可逆。</p>\n<h2 id=\"pcm-编码基础\">PCM 编码基础</h2><p>PCM（Pulse Code Modulation，脉冲编码调制）是数字音频最基本的编码方式。它以固定时间间隔对模拟信号采样，将每个采样值量化为固定位数的整数，按时间顺序存储。PCM 数据是&quot;生的&quot;（raw）数字音频——没有任何压缩或变换，是所有其他编码格式的基础。</p>\n<p>PCM 数据流的参数三元组：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>PCM</mtext><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>N</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>采样率, 位深度, 通道数</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{PCM} = (f_s, N, C) = (\\text{采样率, 位深度, 通道数})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">PCM</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">采样率</span><span class=\"mord\">, </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">位深度</span><span class=\"mord\">, </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">通道数</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>存储空间需求：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Size (bytes)</mtext><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mo>×</mo><mfrac><mi>N</mi><mn>8</mn></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Size (bytes)} = f_s \\times \\frac{N}{8} \\times C \\times T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Size (bytes)</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">8</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>一分钟 CD 品质立体声音频：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>44100</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>60</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>10.58</mn><mtext> MB</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">44100 \\times 2 \\times 2 \\times 60 = 10.58 \\text{ MB}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">44100</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">60</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10.58</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> MB</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    A[&quot;模拟信号&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;采样 44.1kHz&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; C[&quot;量化 16-bit&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; D[&quot;PCM 数据流&lt;br/&gt;1411.2 kbps&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; E[&quot;WAV 容器&lt;br/&gt;(加文件头)&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; F[&quot;FLAC 压缩&lt;br/&gt;(无损~700kbps)&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; G[&quot;AAC 编码&lt;br/&gt;(有损~256kbps)&quot;]\">flowchart LR\n    A[\"模拟信号\"] --&gt; B[\"采样 44.1kHz\"]\n    B --&gt; C[\"量化 16-bit\"]\n    C --&gt; D[\"PCM 数据流&lt;br/&gt;1411.2 kbps\"]\n    D --&gt; E[\"WAV 容器&lt;br/&gt;(加文件头)\"]\n    D --&gt; F[\"FLAC 压缩&lt;br/&gt;(无损~700kbps)\"]\n    D --&gt; G[\"AAC 编码&lt;br/&gt;(有损~256kbps)\"]</pre><h2 id=\"有损压缩的心理声学原理\">有损压缩的心理声学原理</h2><p>有损音频编码（MP3、AAC、Opus）的核心思想是：利用人耳感知的局限性，移除那些&quot;人耳听不到或不敏感&quot;的信息。这些局限性被统称为<strong>心理声学模型</strong>（Psychoacoustic Model）。</p>\n<p>三大心理声学现象：</p>\n<p><strong>频率掩蔽</strong>（Frequency Masking）：一个强的频率成分会&quot;遮盖&quot;其附近较弱的频率成分。被遮盖的成分即使被移除，人耳也察觉不到。</p>\n<p><strong>时间掩蔽</strong>（Temporal Masking）：一个响亮的瞬态（如鼓击）之后约 5-20ms 内，较弱的声音会被掩蔽（后掩蔽）；瞬态之前约 2-5ms 也存在预掩蔽。</p>\n<p><strong>绝对听觉阈值</strong>（Absolute Threshold of Hearing）：不同频率下人耳的最低可感知响度不同。4 kHz 附近最灵敏，低频和极高频处阈值显著升高。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>掩蔽类型</th>\n<th>原理</th>\n<th>编码利用方式</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>频率掩蔽</td>\n<td>强频遮盖邻近弱频</td>\n<td>降低被掩蔽频段的位分配</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>时间掩蔽</td>\n<td>瞬态前后短时遮盖</td>\n<td>瞬态附近使用更粗糙量化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>绝对阈值</td>\n<td>不同频率灵敏度不同</td>\n<td>低灵敏度频段少分配位</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"主流编解码器对比\">主流编解码器对比</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>编码器</th>\n<th>年份</th>\n<th>类型</th>\n<th>典型比特率</th>\n<th>延迟</th>\n<th>主要用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>MP3</td>\n<td>1993</td>\n<td>有损</td>\n<td>128-320 kbps</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>历史标准</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>AAC-LC</td>\n<td>1997</td>\n<td>有损</td>\n<td>128-256 kbps</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>Apple/YouTube</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Vorbis</td>\n<td>2000</td>\n<td>有损</td>\n<td>96-320 kbps</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>开源替代</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Opus</td>\n<td>2012</td>\n<td>有损</td>\n<td>6-510 kbps</td>\n<td>极低</td>\n<td>VoIP/流媒体</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>FLAC</td>\n<td>2001</td>\n<td>无损</td>\n<td>~800-1200 kbps</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>存档/HiFi</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ALAC</td>\n<td>2004</td>\n<td>无损</td>\n<td>~700-1100 kbps</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>Apple 生态</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Opus 是 2020 年代综合性能最强的有损编码器——它在语音（低比特率）和音乐（高比特率）场景中都表现出色，延迟极低（最低 2.5ms），是 WebRTC、Discord、Zoom 等实时通信的默认音频编码。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Opus 优势</mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>低延迟</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>自适应比特率</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>宽比特率范围</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>免版税</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Opus 优势} = \\text{低延迟} + \\text{自适应比特率} + \\text{宽比特率范围} + \\text{免版税}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Opus </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">优势</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">低延迟</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">自适应比特率</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">宽比特率范围</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">免版税</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><h2 id=\"音频容器格式\">音频容器格式</h2><p>编码数据需要封装在容器格式（Container Format）中才能成为完整的文件：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[&quot;音频容器格式&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;WAV (.wav)&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; C[&quot;AIFF (.aiff)&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; D[&quot;MP4 (.m4a)&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; E[&quot;Ogg (.ogg)&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; F[&quot;Matroska (.mka)&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; B1[&quot;PCM/浮点&lt;br/&gt;Windows 标准&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; C1[&quot;PCM&lt;br/&gt;Mac 标准&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; D1[&quot;AAC/ALAC&lt;br/&gt;Apple 生态&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt; E1[&quot;Vorbis/Opus&lt;br/&gt;开源生态&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    A[\"音频容器格式\"] --&gt; B[\"WAV (.wav)\"]\n    A --&gt; C[\"AIFF (.aiff)\"]\n    A --&gt; D[\"MP4 (.m4a)\"]\n    A --&gt; E[\"Ogg (.ogg)\"]\n    A --&gt; F[\"Matroska (.mka)\"]\n    B --&gt; B1[\"PCM/浮点&lt;br/&gt;Windows 标准\"]\n    C --&gt; C1[\"PCM&lt;br/&gt;Mac 标准\"]\n    D --&gt; D1[\"AAC/ALAC&lt;br/&gt;Apple 生态\"]\n    E --&gt; E1[\"Vorbis/Opus&lt;br/&gt;开源生态\"]</pre><p>容器与编码的区别：WAV 是容器（可以装 PCM、也可以装 ADPCM），AAC 是编码（可以装在 MP4 容器中，也可以装在 ADTS 裸流中）。</p>\n<p>选择容器时可遵循几条经验规则：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>录音棚制作、需要无损与极广兼容时选 WAV/AIFF</li>\n<li>Apple 生态内分发选 MP4 容器 + AAC 或 ALAC</li>\n<li>开源/跨平台分发选 Ogg 容器 + Vorbis/Opus</li>\n<li>影视多语言/多音轨选 MKV（Matroska）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"流媒体传输协议\">流媒体传输协议</h2><p>2025 年的音频流媒体涉及多种传输协议：</p>\n<p><strong>HLS (HTTP Live Streaming)</strong>：Apple 主导，将音频分割为小片段（通常 6-10 秒）通过 HTTP 传输。自适应比特率切换。</p>\n<p><strong>DASH (Dynamic Adaptive Streaming over HTTP)</strong>：开放标准，与 HLS 类似但更灵活。</p>\n<p><strong>WebRTC</strong>：点对点实时通信，延迟可低至 50ms。使用 Opus 编码。</p>\n<p><strong>AES67/Dante</strong>：专业音频网络传输，延迟低于 1ms，用于录音棚、演出场所。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>协议</th>\n<th>延迟</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n<th>编码</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>HLS</td>\n<td>6-30s</td>\n<td>音乐流媒体</td>\n<td>AAC/FLAC</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>DASH</td>\n<td>2-10s</td>\n<td>视频平台音频</td>\n<td>AAC/Opus</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>WebRTC</td>\n<td>50-150ms</td>\n<td>实时通话/协作</td>\n<td>Opus</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>AES67</td>\n<td>&lt;1ms</td>\n<td>专业音频联网</td>\n<td>PCM</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SRT</td>\n<td>120ms-8s</td>\n<td>直播推流</td>\n<td>AAC/Opus</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>2024-2025 年的趋势是<strong>低延迟流媒体</strong>的兴起——Spotify 的 2025 年更新将播放启动延迟降至 200ms 以下，Apple Music 也在优化端到端延迟以支持同步聆听（SharePlay 音乐同步）等社交功能。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>音频编解码围绕 PCM 这一基准展开：编码器负责压缩，容器负责封装，协议负责传输，三者解耦后可以自由组合。有损编码的压缩空间来自心理声学模型对掩蔽效应与听觉阈值的利用，无损编码则只做可逆压缩。Opus 因其低延迟与宽比特率范围成为实时通信的默认选择，而 HLS/DASH/AES67 分别服务于点播、自适应流与专业网络三种延迟档位。近年来的竞争焦点从&quot;更高压缩比&quot;转向&quot;更低启动延迟与更高保真度&quot;。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"音频编解码与传输","id":"音频编解码与传输"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"PCM 编码基础","id":"pcm-编码基础"},{"level":2,"text":"有损压缩的心理声学原理","id":"有损压缩的心理声学原理"},{"level":2,"text":"主流编解码器对比","id":"主流编解码器对比"},{"level":2,"text":"音频容器格式","id":"音频容器格式"},{"level":2,"text":"流媒体传输协议","id":"流媒体传输协议"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"量化精度与动态范围","url":"/l-doc-books/h/music-audio/audio-signal-processing/digital-audio-basics/quantization"},"next":{"title":"FFT 频谱分析原理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/music-audio/audio-signal-processing/spectral-analysis/fft-fundamentals"}}